# AfriPay Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` in the `backend/` directory and fill in values for local development.

```env
# Server
PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=development
API_KEY=
PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Database (run backend/migrations/001_payment_state.sql before production use)
DATABASE_URL=
MOMO_AUTO_MIGRATE=true
MOMO_RECONCILIATION_INTERVAL_MS=300000

# Redis (used by exchange-rate caching)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Stellar / Soroban (Testnet only; payment intent routes build and submit XLM transactions)
STELLAR_NETWORK=testnet
STELLAR_HORIZON_URL=https://horizon-testnet.stellar.org
STELLAR_RPC_URL=https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org
STELLAR_PAYMENT_GATEWAY_CONTRACT_ID=CB656MBZCHK5BMYUVNJQYAFIAWFNJZ2PASDYU7WCSVX34SUC6E5M3VCG
STELLAR_ESCROW_CONTRACT_ID=CCAL4FLLFKKCAT5NBFSDB7RH6GJYNBAPBJNIIJO5PZOEPHB23HXGCTCY
STELLAR_MULTISIG_CONTRACT_ID=CC2KFAKQMON3TZ6L2LEUXOTGZHMDBYVTV5XJR2O24NKPJTEYHJJXIA67
STELLAR_VAULT_CONTRACT_ID=CAT5D3LJHARIS7GNGCWABZGOQG64JZZLDG4IMRJ22CPNU37A3G5DX5II

# Exchange rates (Open Exchange Rates)
OPEN_EXCHANGE_RATES_APP_ID=

# MTN Mobile Money (sandbox by default)
MTN_MOMO_BASE_URL=https://sandbox.momodeveloper.mtn.com
MTN_MOMO_TARGET_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
MTN_MOMO_API_KEY=
MTN_MOMO_COLLECTION_API_USER=
MTN_MOMO_COLLECTION_API_SECRET=
MTN_MOMO_DISBURSEMENT_API_USER=
MTN_MOMO_DISBURSEMENT_API_SECRET=
MTN_MOMO_CALLBACK_URL=
MTN_MOMO_WEBHOOK_TOKEN=

# Africa's Talking USSD (when wired to production callback URL)
AFRICASTALKING_USERNAME=
AFRICASTALKING_API_KEY=
```

Never commit real API keys, secrets, or wallet private keys.
